<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Indira Gandhi Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>China beat India 2-1 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers: China - Chen Hui 13, 62</p>
<p>India - Pritam Thakran 23</p>
